\subsection{Other notes}{

Some combinations of \code{probability.model} and \code{link} are rejected, while
others warn and continue using the link supported by \code{ordinalgmifs}. The
engine translates the standardized \code{odds_link} and \code{ordinal_link}
arguments but does not check model and link compatibility in advance.
}

